Package: SparseMatrix
Type: Package
Title: Build Sparse Matrices from OHDSI Cohort Features
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Study", "Team", email = "study@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates study cohorts and patient-level covariates and converts the
    persisted artifacts into deterministic sparse matrices. Andromeda-backed
    processing limits in-memory work while retaining the source identifier maps.
